---
import Head from "../components/Head.astro";
import Hero from "../components/Hero.astro";
import "../styles/home.css";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <Head
      title="Artifisi"
      description="Artifisi is an AI company in Kuala Lumpur. Dunia turns gameplay into labelled training data for robots and physical AI, and we make our own games to run it in."
    />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  </head>
  <body>
<Hero>
  <h1>People play games. <span>We turn what they do into training data for AI.</span></h1>
</Hero>

<section class="band company" id="company">
  <canvas class="co-bg" data-fx="field" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
  <div class="inner">
    <div class="label">Company profile</div>
    <h2>Artifisi Sdn Bhd</h2>
    <p class="lead">An AI company in Kuala Lumpur. We build Dunia, an SDK that turns gameplay into labelled training data for robots and physical AI, and we make our own games to run it in.</p>
    <div class="vm">
      <div><div class="label">Vision</div><p>Machines that learn from the way people play.</p></div>
      <div><div class="label">Mission</div><p>Make games people want to play, and turn that play into data that machines can learn from.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="co-facts">
      <div><b>Founded</b>2023, full time since 2025</div>
      <div><b>Status</b>Malaysia Digital, Sept 2026</div>
      <div><b>Focus</b>Training data for physical AI</div>
      <div><b>Based in</b>Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band ai" id="ai">
  <div class="inner">
    <div>
      <div class="label">AI division</div>
      <h2>Dunia</h2>
      <p>Robots learn from examples: what the world looked like, what the agent did, and what happened next. That data is slow and expensive to collect with real robots. A game engine already knows all of it.</p>
      <p>Dunia is an SDK that sits inside the engine and records state, inputs and outcomes at each decision while someone plays. Every step comes out labelled.</p>
      <dl class="facts">
        <dt>Product</dt><dd>SDK for game engines</dd>
        <dt>Output</dt><dd>State, action, outcome, labelled</dd>
        <dt>Status</dt><dd>MVP running in our demo game</dd>
        <dt>For</dt><dd>Robotics and physical AI teams</dd>
      </dl>
      <a class="btn dark" href="#pilot">How a pilot works</a>
    </div>
    <a class="poster" href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1LXIHbQJDbuIhn9IO3W_bTsaKVkwKXOuR/view" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-embed="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1LXIHbQJDbuIhn9IO3W_bTsaKVkwKXOuR/preview">
      <canvas class="poster-gl" data-fx="dunia" aria-hidden="true"></canvas><span class="play" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="cap">Dunia demo · the SDK MVP in our demo game</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band pilot" id="pilot">
  <div class="inner">
    <div class="pilot-head">
      <div class="label">Pilot partners</div>
      <h2>We're looking for pilot partners on both sides</h2>
      <p class="pilot-lead">Dunia sits between the games people play and the teams that train on gameplay. We want to run the first pilots with both.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pilot-tracks">
      <div class="track">
        <div class="label">For AI and robotics teams</div>
        <h3>Need training data for a specific task?</h3>
        <p>Tell us the task and the format you train on. We build a game scenario for it, record real play with Dunia, and you test the labelled data in your own pipeline.</p>
        <p class="get"><b>You get</b>Data shaped for your problem, and a say in what the SDK does next.</p>
        <a class="btn pilot-btn" href="#contact" data-topic="Pilot: AI or robotics team">Apply as an AI team</a>
      </div>
      <div class="track">
        <div class="label">For game studios</div>
        <h3>Have a game people already play?</h3>
        <p>We put Dunia inside it, record play as labelled data, and work with you on turning that data into a new source of revenue for the game.</p>
        <p class="get"><b>You get</b>Early access to the SDK, and a say in how it fits your engine.</p>
        <a class="btn pilot-btn" href="#contact" data-topic="Pilot: game studio">Apply as a game studio</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="pilot-ask"><b>What we ask</b>A real problem or a real game, and honest feedback.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band games" id="games">
  <div class="inner">
    <div class="label">Gaming division</div>
    <h2>Our games</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--gray-4);max-width:620px">Original IP, made by two people in KL. They are games first. They are also where Dunia gets to run before it goes into anyone else's game.</p>
    <div class="grid3">
      <article class="game" id="melaka">
        <img src="/img/melaka-1511.jpg" alt="Melaka 1511" width="720" height="405">
        <div class="game-body">
          <div class="label">In development</div>
          <h3><a href="/projects/melaka-1511">Melaka 1511</a></h3>
          <p>Turn-based strategy in the Melaka Sultanate. Start weak after the fall of Temasek, use officers like Tun Perak and Hang Tuah, and unite the peninsula before the Portuguese arrive. Voxel art, PC first.</p>
          <div class="game-links"><a href="https://youtu.be/4TbsJau7QmA" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-embed="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/4TbsJau7QmA?autoplay=1&rel=0">Watch the video</a></div>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="game" id="orbwalker">
        <img src="/img/orbwalker.jpg" alt="Orbwalker" width="720" height="405">
        <div class="game-body">
          <div class="label">Playable</div>
          <h3><a href="/projects/orbwalker">Orbwalker</a></h3>
          <p>A fantasy match-3 roguelike for mobile, with free orb movement and build-driven runs. One person built it from an empty project in three months.</p>
          <div class="game-links"><a href="https://rajahafify.itch.io/orbwalker" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Play on itch.io</a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/shorts/yOek_scKUMY" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-embed="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/yOek_scKUMY?autoplay=1&rel=0" data-tall>Watch the short</a></div>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="game" id="hullpack">
        <img src="/img/hullpack-hero.png" alt="Hullpack Hero" width="315" height="250" style="object-position:center top">
        <div class="game-body">
          <div class="label">Early development</div>
          <h3>Hullpack Hero</h3>
          <p>Eve Online meets Backpack Hero, set in our own solar system.</p>
          <div class="game-links"><a href="https://youtu.be/_Ro_OxFiU68" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-embed="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/_Ro_OxFiU68?autoplay=1&rel=0">Watch the video</a></div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band about" id="about">
  <div class="inner">
    <div>
      <div class="label">About</div>
      <h2>Built in Kuala Lumpur</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--gray-4)">Registered in Malaysia, with Malaysia Digital status since September 2026.</p>
      <canvas class="map" data-fx="malaysia" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
    </div>
    <div class="person">
      <div class="label">Founder</div>
      <h3 class="pname">Raja Hafify <a class="li" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/rajahafify/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Raja Hafify on LinkedIn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M20.45 20.45h-3.56v-5.57c0-1.33-.02-3.04-1.85-3.04-1.85 0-2.14 1.45-2.14 2.94v5.67H9.35V9h3.41v1.56h.05c.48-.9 1.64-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.6 0 4.27 2.37 4.27 5.46v6.28zM5.34 7.43a2.06 2.06 0 1 1 0-4.13 2.06 2.06 0 0 1 0 4.13zM7.12 20.45H3.56V9h3.56v11.45zM22.22 0H1.77C.79 0 0 .77 0 1.73v20.54C0 23.23.79 24 1.77 24h20.45c.98 0 1.78-.77 1.78-1.73V1.73C24 .77 23.2 0 22.22 0z"/></svg></a></h3>
      <p style="margin-top:12px">Hafify has spent twelve years building software, at startups and at AirAsia, and the last two of those on AI. Artifisi started in 2023 doing software and AI work for clients. In 2025 Hafify took it full time to build Dunia and the games it runs in.</p>
      <p>Hafify built Orbwalker alone, from an empty project to a playable game, in three months.</p>
      <ul class="cv">
        <li><b>Experience</b><span>12 years in software</span></li>
        <li><b>Before</b><span>Startups and AirAsia</span></li>
        <li><b>Focus</b><span>AI for the last two years</span></li>
        <li><b>Built</b><span>Dunia SDK MVP, Orbwalker</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band contact" id="contact">
  <div class="inner">
    <div>
      <div class="label">Contact</div>
      <h2>Talk to us</h2>
      <p class="contact-note">Pilot partners, our games, or anything else. We reply from hello@artifisi.com.</p>
      <div class="rows">
        <div class="row"><div class="label">Email</div><a href="mailto:hello@artifisi.com">hello@artifisi.com</a></div>
        <div class="row"><div class="label">X</div><a href="https://x.com/artifisi_my" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@artifisi_my</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <form class="cform" id="cform" action="https://formspree.io/f/xeaaobag" method="POST">
      <label>Name<input name="name" autocomplete="name" required></label>
      <label>Email<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required></label>
      <label>About
        <select name="topic" id="ctopic">
          <option>Pilot: AI or robotics team</option>
          <option>Pilot: game studio</option>
          <option>Our games</option>
          <option>Investing</option>
          <option>Something else</option>
        </select>
      </label>
      <label>Message<textarea name="message" rows="5" required></textarea></label>
      <input type="text" name="_gotcha" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" class="hp" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="cform-foot"><button type="submit" class="btn">Send</button><span class="cform-msg" id="cform-msg" role="status"></span></div>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>
<footer><div class="inner">Artifisi Sdn Bhd · Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia · <a href="/privacy">Privacy</a></div></footer>

<dialog class="vmodal" id="vmodal" aria-label="Video"><button type="button" class="vclose" id="vclose">Close ✕</button><div class="vframe"></div></dialog>

<script>
  import "../scripts/home.js";
</script>
  </body>
</html>
